# UI (match `docs/design/reference.png`)

- Canvas `#EEF1FF`, glass cards `rounded-[2rem] bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-xl`
- Accents: lavender `#7C6CF6`, pink `#FF8FB3`, mint `#5EEAD4`, sun `#FFD56A`
- CTAs: coral-pink gradient, full width, circular arrow chip on the right
- Rounded sans (Nunito). Soft colored shadows, never harsh gray boxes
- App screens: greeting + mascot, Today’s Focus + progress ring, 7-dot streak,
  pastel category tiles, 2×2 quick actions, bottom tab bar
- Prefer CSS/SVG clay-glass illustrations over stock photos
- Mobile-first; on desktop center a phone-width column (`max-w-md`)
